Subject: [PATCH 31/42] GeckoView on iOS keeps logins in Gecko's own store

Saving or changing a password from the login prompt writes to
Services.logins (logins.json, NSS-encrypted) on iOS, where autofill reads
from it; LegacyFoxLogins lets the shell list, add and remove them.
